==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rising Rivals|Growlithe|63}} from the {{TCG|Rising Rivals}} expansion.
*'''Combustion''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Destiny|Slugma|82}} from {{TCG|Neo Destiny}}.
